{title: 213 - Jesus Is Coming Again}
{subtitle: SDA Hymnal #213 • }
{lyricist: }
{composer: }
{key: A}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{meta: hymn_number 213}
{meta: category Jesus Christ - }

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[A]Lift up the trumpet, and [E]loud let it ring: [A]Jesus is com[B7]ing a[E]gain!
[A]Cheer up, ye pilgrims, be [E]joy[A7]ful and [D]sing: Jesus is [A]com[E7]ing a[A]gain!
[A]Coming again, [D]coming a[E]gain, [A]Je[D]sus is [A]com[E7]ing a[A]gain!
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Refrain}
[A][E]Coming [A]again, [B7]coming [E]again,
[A][E]Jesus [A7][D]is [A][E7]coming [A]again!
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[A]Echo [E]it, [A]hilltops; proclaim [B7]it, [E]ye plains:
[A][E]Jesus [A7][D]is [A][E7]coming [A]again!
[A]Coming [D]in [E]glory, [A]the [D]Lamb [A]that [E7]was [A]slain;
[A][E]Jesus [A]is [B7]coming [E]again!
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[A]Heavings [E]of earth, [A]tell [B7]the vast, [E]wondering throng:
[A][E]Jesus [A7][D]is [A][E7]coming [A]again!
[A][D]Tempests [E]and [A]whirlwinds, [D][A]the [E7]anthem [A]prolong;
[A][E]Jesus [A]is [B7]coming [E]again!
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 4}
[A]Nations [E]are [A]angry--by this [B7]we [E]do know
[A][E]Jesus [A7][D]is [A][E7]coming [A]again!
[A][D]Knowledge [E]increases; [A]men [D]run [A]to [E7]and [A]fro;
[A][E]Jesus [A]is [B7]coming [E]again!
{end_of_verse}
